  "rows": [
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "お疲れさまで～す！\nあれ？　きょうじくんたち、元気ないね？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "姫野 かのん"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_e:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 44,
          "target_step_index": 4
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ああ、実は……",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "鷹城 恭二"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_e:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 44,
          "target_step_index": 7
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "店内放送？\nなーんだ、そんなことか！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "橘 志狼"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_e:step-13:text",
        "step_id": 13,
        "step_index": 12,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 44,
          "target_step_index": 12
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "だったら、かのんたちが教えてあげる！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "姫野 かのん"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_e:step-14:text",
        "step_id": 14,
        "step_index": 13,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 44,
          "target_step_index": 13
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "声優をしたことがあるので、\n簡単なことなら教えられると思います。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "岡村 直央"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_e:step-15:text",
        "step_id": 15,
        "step_index": 14,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 44,
          "target_step_index": 14
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "もふもふえんが、教えてくれる？　やった！\nそれなら、お仕事、大成功する！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "ピエール"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_e:step-19:text",
        "step_id": 19,
        "step_index": 18,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 44,
          "target_step_index": 18
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そうだね。強力な助っ人が来てくれて助かったよ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_e:step-20:text",
        "step_id": 20,
        "step_index": 19,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 44,
          "target_step_index": 19
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "え、えへへ……。\nお手伝いできるよう、頑張ります！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "岡村 直央"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_e:step-21:text",
        "step_id": 21,
        "step_index": 20,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 44,
          "target_step_index": 20
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "●●●●プロデューサーさん、\nかのんたちの予定は～？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "姫野 かのん"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_e:step-25:text",
        "step_id": 25,
        "step_index": 24,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 44,
          "target_step_index": 24
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "もふもふえんの皆さんも、\n収録の日は空いていますね！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_e:step-26:text",
        "step_id": 26,
        "step_index": 25,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 44,
          "target_step_index": 25
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "よっしゃ！　それじゃオレたちが、\n当日にビシバシしごいてやるぜ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "橘 志狼"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_e:step-27:text",
        "step_id": 27,
        "step_index": 26,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 44,
          "target_step_index": 26
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "source_text": "その夜……",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "none",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": ""
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_e:step-31:caption",
        "step_id": 31,
        "step_index": 30,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 44,
          "target_step_index": 30
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……もしもし。●●●●プロデューサーですか？\nオレです、翼です。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "柏木 翼"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_e:step-34:text",
        "step_id": 34,
        "step_index": 33,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 44,
          "target_step_index": 33
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "突然電話して、すみません。\nBeitのみんなが一日店長をすると聞いて……",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "柏木 翼"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_e:step-35:text",
        "step_id": 35,
        "step_index": 34,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 44,
          "target_step_index": 34
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "店内アナウンスもするんですよね？\nうう、緊張するだろうなぁ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "柏木 翼"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_e:step-36:text",
        "step_id": 36,
        "step_index": 35,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 44,
          "target_step_index": 35
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "オレもパイロットの候補生だった時に、\nアナウンスの練習をしていたんですよ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "柏木 翼"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_07_e:step-37:text",
        "step_id": 37,
        "step_index": 36,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_07_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_07_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 44,
          "target_step_index": 36
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "choice",
      "source_text": "どんなことを\nしていたんですか？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "none",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": ""
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
